{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs1yrwxdnvHNhV7iQnC8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The error message now names the broken arc (`vllm`) and the full chain, and the new regression test passes. I did not commit.\n\n**What changed**\n\n- `src/fromager/bootstrapper/_resolve.py`: `Resolve.run()` catches the `ResolverException` from the background resolution and re-raises it with `(required by <parent>, dependency chain: <a -> b -> c>)` appended. The parent is the last entry of `why_snapshot`, and the chain is built from the `why_snapshot` names. The original exception is chained with `from err`. If there is no `why_snapshot` (top-level requirement), the exception is re-raised unchanged.\n- `tests/test_bootstrapper_iterative.py`: added `TestPhaseResolve.test_resolver_error_names_broken_parent`. It sets a failed future for `flashinfer-python` with the chain `its-hub -> reward-hub -> vllm` and asserts the message names `vllm` and the full chain.\n\n**Test results**\n\n- New test: passes.\n- `tests/test_bootstrapper_iterative.py`: 108 passed, 1 failed. The failure is `TestPhasePrepareSource::test_constraint_logged_when_present`, which also fails on the clean tree, so it predates this change.\n\n**Things to know**\n\n- The `ERROR` prefix still shows the active top-level package (`its-hub`), because the logging context is unchanged. The message body is what now says the broken arc is `vllm`. I did not change the logging context.\n- I could not find `ENABLE_REPEATABLE_BUILD_MODE` anywhere in `src/` or `tests/`. I took the repeatable-build path to be the iterative `Resolve` phase, which is where the failure surfaces. I did not run an end-to-end build to confirm that.\n- `ruff` is not in `.venv`, so I could not run `hatch run lint:fix`. I formatted the new test by hand to match the surrounding style."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5702,"cache_read_input_tokens":153423,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5702},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35f433c2-958b-4c74-a970-a281494a8aa9","uuid":"bd6ce677-ec38-4371-91bb-721ad41c0f5d","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:58:02.901Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs1yrdrvHvoV8mZVrLKP"}
